---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How The Product Bet collects and uses data." narrow>
  <header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">Last updated: 27 August 2026</p>
  </header>
  <article class="prose">
    <p>
      This site, blog.tabassumkhanum.in (&ldquo;The Product Bet&rdquo;), is a personal blog run by
      Tabassum Khanum. This page explains what data is collected when you visit, and how it's used.
    </p>

    <h2>What's collected</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Analytics.</strong> I use Google Analytics to understand which posts people read and
      where visitors come from. This collects anonymised data such as pages visited, approximate
      location (city level), device type, and referring site. It uses cookies. Google's privacy
      policy is at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Newsletter.</strong> If you subscribe, your email address is stored with Buttondown,
      the service that sends the emails. I use it only to send you new posts. Every email has an
      unsubscribe link, and unsubscribing deletes you from the list. Buttondown's privacy policy is
      at <a href="https://buttondown.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">buttondown.com/legal/privacy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Contact.</strong> If you email me, I'll keep your message to reply to it. I don't add
      contact emails to any list.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Advertising.</strong> This site may display ads served by Google AdSense or similar
      networks. These networks may use cookies to show ads based on your prior visits to this and
      other sites. You can opt out of personalised advertising at
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">google.com/settings/ads</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Affiliate links.</strong> Some posts contain affiliate links (see the
      <a href="/disclosure">Disclosure</a> page). Clicking them may set a cookie from the merchant
      so the referral can be tracked.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are used only for the analytics and advertising described above. You can block or
      delete cookies in your browser settings; the site will still work.
    </p>

    <h2>What's not collected</h2>
    <p>No accounts, no payment details, no data sold or shared with anyone beyond the services named above.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask me to delete any data I hold about you (for example your newsletter email) by
      writing to <a href="mailto:tabassumk7484@gmail.com">tabassumk7484@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the date at the top will be updated.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
